\title{thanatome: donor death signatures for post-mortem control tissue}
\description{
Annotates each sample of a post-mortem tissue cohort with its position
along two transcriptional axes of donor death derived from GTEx v8 in
ten tissues (ventilator / perfusion and prolonged agony), plus the ischemia
component of the ventilator axis, lets the user plot and select samples with explicit criteria,
exports the per-sample scores as covariates, and annotates existing
differential-expression tables with the axes their genes fall in.
}
\details{
The main entry point is \code{\link[=thanatome_score]{thanatome_score()}}. See the vignette
\code{vignette("thanatome")} for a worked example.
}
